WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:07.840
Silicon Valley may be home to some of the
biggest tech giants in the world,

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.240
but it's being challenged like never before.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.720
Crazy tech geniuses have popped up all over the planet

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.220
making things that will blow your mind.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.860
My name is Ashlee Vance, I'm an author and journalist,

00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:26.029
and I'm on a quest to find the
most innovative tech creations

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.300
and meet the beautiful freaks behind them.

